WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.000
Nobody was home. So the parcel goes back.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.200
In Japan, that happens 400 million times a year.

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:15.000
A parcel can only go to one fixed place. Your address.

4
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:20.200
But people don't stay in one place.

5
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:27.400
So let the parcel come to you. A spot on the street, where the van pulls over.

6
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:34.600
Delivery OS. Packages adapt to people.
